    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68331" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόλῐβ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Ep.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόλυβδος</span> (q.v.),
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lead</i>, once in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόλιβος ὣς ἐτράπετ᾽ αἰχμή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.237
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.</u>
				3.1.30
			</span></i>: also fem., <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.723
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.); also found in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				121.52
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">i B.C.</span>, pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.1177.301
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Bodl.</u>
				 iii 310
			</span></i> (prob. <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>), and codd. of <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				80.7
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				90.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				14.25
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
